<section class="copy-section" id="what-the-findings-can-and-cannot-tell-you" aria-labelledby="what-the-findings-can-and-cannot-tell-you-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="what-the-findings-can-and-cannot-tell-you-heading">What the findings can&#x2014;and cannot&#x2014;tell you</h2></div><div class="section-detail">
<p>We review what is disclosed, observable or otherwise lawfully accessible within your authorized environment and agreed scope. We do not prove how information reached someone else, identify an actor, investigate an investigator, reconstruct events forensically or collect court evidence. Recovering copies of information already shared is outside this service. We do not guarantee that every exposure will be found or removed.</p>
<p>An attorney or adviser can receive a summary only with your authorization. It remains a practical account of the work, not legal advice or a forensic report.</p>
<p>You remain present, approve material changes and control your credentials. Toza does not keep them for ongoing use, remotely control your devices, monitor them or install security software on them.</p>
<p><a href="/en/faq.html">Privacy and service boundaries</a></p>
</div></div></section>
